            <p class="feature__lead">The standard 14 fonts are built in and ship with every reader. Embed TrueType, OpenType or Type1 and they compile as composite CID fonts with a <span class="code-inline code-inline--lg">/ToUnicode</span> CMap &mdash; so non-Latin text renders correctly <em>and</em> still copies and extracts.</p>
